        <key>anchorPolicy</key>
        <string>Keep the native Z-body coordinate for each active semantic role, translate it with the drawing, and use the corresponding existing Cyrillic mark class. Move only the bottom role below the actual new return. Zero placeholders are not promoted to active coordinates.</string>
